  m_Text: "States are institutions of centralized violence which create more problems
    than they ostensibly exist to solve. Anarchy, the absence of rulership, is achieved
    by hindering, dismantling, and preventing any situations where someone has power
    over others. In this way it is not a destination, but a direction. There is no
